        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 138078d6-0e9f-4e27-8ffb-373d6bbc6b62).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Chongqing is a city of dualities. Your targets tonight are a scattered group of random civilians and local homeless dwellers. \r\rDo not let their status fool you. They are unwitting carriers of stolen data nodes, some surgically implanted in their minds. They are currently wandering the rain-slicked alleys and the ruins of The Block. \r\rPrecision is vital to avoid collateral damage. Use the persistent downpour and vertical rooftops for cover. \r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
